Name = GameBaiters Soundboard
Type = Plugin
Author = GameBaiters (gamebaiters.net) - based on RP Soundboard by Marius Graefe
Version = @version@
Platforms = win32, win64, linux_amd64, mac
Description = GameBaiters Soundboard - a from-scratch UI rewrite of the classic RP Soundboard. Multi-channel playback, per-channel pitch / speed / reverb, link locks, macros that snapshot every channel, and a single-DLL package with FFmpeg statically linked. No external tools, no TeamSpeak settings to change.

Built and maintained by GameBaiters: https://gamebaiters.net
Original source: RP Soundboard by Marius Graefe (2015-2019).

Note:
Your microphone stays open while a sound plays unless "Mute myself during playback" is enabled. This is a limit of the TeamSpeak plugin sound interface and cannot be changed.

Disclaimer:
This software uses code of FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) licensed under the LGPLv2.1 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html). The exact FFmpeg source used in this build (tag n8.1.1) is available from https://ffmpeg.org/download.html or by request at https://gamebaiters.net.